WEBVTT

00:11:57.475 --> 00:12:00.138
The teachers are unhappy
because they leave work late.

00:12:00.162 --> 00:12:01.893
And you feel terribly guilty.

00:12:02.496 --> 00:12:06.190
This daycare program in Israel
decided they wanted to stop this problem,

00:12:06.214 --> 00:12:09.223
and they did something that many
daycare programs in the US do,

00:12:09.247 --> 00:12:11.777
which is they installed
a fine for late pickups.

00:12:11.801 --> 00:12:14.877
And the fine they chose was 10 shekels,

00:12:14.901 --> 00:12:16.521
which is about three bucks.

00:12:17.257 --> 00:12:18.529
And guess what happened?

00:12:19.191 --> 00:12:21.112
Late pickups increased.

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:24.803
And if you think about it,
it makes perfect sense.

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:26.352
What a deal!

00:12:26.376 --> 00:12:27.543
For 10 shekels --

00:12:27.567 --> 00:12:28.849
(Laughter)

00:12:28.873 --> 00:12:30.617
you can keep my kids all night!